    "notes": "Eight-beat, asynchronous three-person feed transcribed from the diagram and listed throw sequences. Ben starts at phase 0; Anne and Clare start one half-beat later. Ben passes single clubs to Anne/Clare; Anne/Clare use crossing single passes to Ben and self throws. Half-beat timeline coordinates are retained; the siteswap variants are included verbatim.",
    "variants": [
      "Anticlockwise and clockwise siteswap forms are listed in the source."
    ],
    "modelLimits": "The pattern is an ordinary three-person feed. No manipulation, zip, simultaneous same-person throws, or holds are represented.",
    "validation": "IsValidForEditor() true after SynchronizeHeights(); cycle offsets unchanged."
